Z||000000||Fierochic88||09-14-2001||07:59 PM||||Joe and I just got back from a candlelit vigil on the lawn of Penn State's Old Main.  It was a very touching ceremony and it made me wonder how many other people across the U.S, Continent and World were lighting candle s tonight?  Just standing in a crowd of people singing patriotic songs such as God Bless America & The Star Spangled Banner brought tears to my eyes.<P>Jennifer||||reg||5
Z||000001||fierobaby||09-14-2001||08:10 PM||||well I know there are alot around here 5 on my pourch 3 on my friends pourch and 3 on my other friends plus around the town people have candles! Its a wounderful site! God Bless America I also handed out flags around my neighbor hood this evening people were very suprised to see two teenages girls running around giving out free flags||||reg||1
